SCHEMA FREEZE: Do not create or edit database migrations in this repo. Use @supabase/supabase-js with database.types.ts.

ADMIN WEB SCOPE: This repo is the Admin Web / Operational Control Tower only
(CMD War Room, Stores, Production KOT TVs, Security Gate, Finance, Dispatch).
Customer-facing catalogue/cart/checkout/order-tracking screens belong in the
Expo React Native app (oasis-baklawa), not here. Do not add customer
storefront pages or routes to this repo.

APPVERSE MISSION CONTROL: Read and obey APPVERSE_THREAD_GUARDRAIL.md. Treat
APPVERSE_MISSION_CONTROL.md and appverse-control/state.json as the programme
routing authority. If a pasted instruction belongs to another workstream or
repository, do not execute it. Respond `ROUTING REJECTED — instruction does
not belong to this thread.`, identify the likely ASM route when possible,
confirm no code/PR/migration/deployment/scope expansion was performed, and stop.
Never equate PR merge with stage clearance.
